      "message": "Discussed offline, as we\u0027re now adding this module\u0027s proguard files to `extraProguardFlagFiles` we should probably rename this to something like `allProguardFlagFiles` and use this in dex.go instead of the combination of `extraProguardFlagFiles`.\n\nUnfortunately we have to temporarily deal with the possibility that an android_app with disabled optimization can specify a non-existent flag file, and we newly call PathForModuleSrc on this flag file which can cause a Soong failure. For now I propose that we make it \"ok\" for there to be a missing file just in the case where the module is an app *and* optimize is disabled (can check for this in collectProguardSpecInfo)",
